; ZX Spectrum 48 BASIC system variables for the Xpeccy+ debugger: the names and
; addresses of the ZX Spectrum BASIC manual, chapter 25 (with OSPPC as the +2 and +3
; manuals spell it), written as names the debugger takes (LAST K as LAST_K).
; Part of Xpeccy+, MIT license.
;
; Converted to the Debugger's text format on 2026-11-20 (docs/debugger-format.md):
; BANK:ADDR NAME SIZE - a RAM cell of that bank, at the CPU address it has at
; #4000-#7FFF, there while a ROM with names of its namespace is in the machine.
05:5C00 BASIC48.KSTATE 8
05:5C08 BASIC48.LAST_K 1
05:5C09 BASIC48.REPDEL 1
05:5C0A BASIC48.REPPER 1
05:5C0B BASIC48.DEFADD 2
05:5C0D BASIC48.K_DATA 1
05:5C0E BASIC48.TVDATA 2
05:5C10 BASIC48.STRMS 38
05:5C36 BASIC48.CHARS 2
05:5C38 BASIC48.RASP 1
05:5C39 BASIC48.PIP 1
05:5C3A BASIC48.ERR_NR 1
